                        "id":  "sporeblight",
                        "title":  "Sporeblight",
                        "category":  "Hazards",
                        "summary":  "Windborne spores root in lungs and can collapse the respiratory system of humanoids, dragons, and aerial megafauna.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Moist cloud banks, floating plants, and fog carry spores for miles. Infection causes cough, breathlessness, throat rash, exhaustion, weakness, and eventually bloodstream spread.",
                                     "Purging magic, antifungal herbs, respiratory filters, and protective wards are the principal responses."
                                 ],
