                        "id":  "skyfungus-growth",
                        "title":  "Skyfungus Growth",
                        "category":  "Hazards",
                        "summary":  "A contagious skin parasite forms painful fungal masses that impair wings, claws, and breathing.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Contact with infected creatures or debris spreads the fungus among Sheffels, Skywhales, and other flying fauna. Redness, swelling, sticky secretion, lumpy masses, weakness, and internal spread follow.",
                                     "Treatment combines surgical removal with strong salves or magic and is safest before the growth becomes extensive."
                                 ],
