                        "id":  "undercloud-rot",
                        "title":  "Undercloud Rot",
                        "category":  "Hazards",
                        "summary":  "A necrotic plant-borne fungus destroys the organs and tissue of herbivores grazing near lower islands and the Abyss.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Infected plants transmit abdominal pain, bloating, blackened tissue, wasting, fever, delirium, and visible necrosis. Once bloodstream infection begins, survival is unlikely.",
                                     "Early herbs and healing magic may halt decay; advanced cases can require amputation."
                                 ],
