                        "id":  "haze-cap-disease",
                        "title":  "Haze Cap Disease",
                        "category":  "Hazards",
                        "summary":  "High-altitude hallucinogenic spores induce euphoria, paranoia, recklessness, aggression, and fungal caps on the body.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The fungus thrives where magical energy is strong and spreads by inhalation or contaminated surfaces. Victims lose coordination and may become self-destructive under vivid sensory distortion.",
                                     "Calming and anti-hallucinogenic medicine can control symptoms, but purification or spiritual healing may be necessary to prevent lasting brain injury."
