                        "title":  "Cloud Fever",
                        "category":  "Hazards",
                        "summary":  "A highly contagious viral fever worsens in damp cloud banks and can leave lasting weakness or neurological injury.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Droplets and contaminated surfaces spread fever, chills, pain, dizziness, cough, exhaustion, hallucinations, confusion, and respiratory distress among humanoid populations.",
                                     "Antiviral medicine, fever reducers, healing magic, isolation, and prolonged rest support recovery."
