                        "title":  "Skyfall Wasting",
                        "category":  "Hazards",
                        "summary":  "A food-, water-, and contact-borne parasite slowly consumes nutrients, muscles, and organs.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Large livestock, mounts, and humans develop fatigue, wasting, appetite loss, jaundice, swollen joints, and uneven breathing. Even survivors may retain lasting damage.",
                                     "Hydration, rich food, restorative medicine, and powerful healing slow or reverse the disease, but no dependable ordinary cure is known."
                                 ],
